cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Retain the unrefereed candidate status and specified construction."
title: "Primitivity of the SU(2n)₂ₙ superconducting series"
authors:
  - name: Anonymous
version: 1.1.0-candidate
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23299598
date-released: 2026-10-11
license:
  - CC0-1.0
  - MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/ipitchford/primitive-su-primitivity
abstract: >-
  Written-proof candidate for primitivity of the specified charge-one
  SU(2n) superconducting construction for every n greater than one.
  A resolved-rank gap and an explicit electron-paired object exclude
  the two allowed vortex factors. Counting ingredients and the family
  are prior work. Finite checks do not prove the universal statement.
  No microscopic realization, experimental validation or formal verification
  is claimed.
